Specifications implemented:
- IETF RFC 9110 / RFC 9112 (HTTP/1.1), RFC 8446 (TLS 1.3 & Section 7.5 Exporters), RFC 8555 (ACME v2)
- IETF RFC 8032 (Ed25519), NIST FIPS 202 (SHA-3 / SHAKE), NIST FIPS 204 (ML-DSA-87)
- IEEE 802.3 / IEEE 802.1Q / IEEE 802.1ad, IETF RFC 791 (IPv4), RFC 8200 (IPv6), RFC 768 (UDP)
- SipHash-2-4 (Aumasson and Bernstein, 2012)
- IETF RFC 9669 (BPF Instruction Set Architecture)

